7.  Command Reference Summary

<!-- end list -->

  * `sygnals-nn create [OPTIONS]`: Creates a Keras model.
      * `--layers`: Neurons/filters per layer.
      * `--layer-types`: Type of each layer (dense, conv1d, flatten, etc.).
      * `--activation`: Activation functions.
      * `--input-shape`: Required for CNNs, defines input dimensions.
