  * `sygnals-nn preprocess [OPTIONS]`: Preprocesses raw data.
      * `--input-data`: Raw data file (CSV/JSON).
      * `--output-data`: Path for processed numerical data (CSV).
      * `--output-preprocessor`: Path to save fitted preprocessor object (.joblib).
      * `--method`: `tfidf`, `count`, `scale`, `label_encode`.
      * `--text-col`, `--label-col`, `--feature-cols`: Specify columns/keys to process.
      * `--json-*`: Specify keys for JSON input.
  * `sygnals-nn train [OPTIONS]`: Trains a Keras model.
      * `--model`: Path to `.keras` model.
      * `--data`: Path to training data (CSV/JSON, usually preprocessed).
      * `--input-cols`, `--label-cols`: Specify feature and label columns/keys.
      * `--json-*`: Specify keys if loading raw JSON directly.
      * `--epochs`, `--batch-size`, `--learning-rate`: Training hyperparameters.
      * `--export-onnx`: Optional path to save trained model as ONNX.
  * `sygnals-nn run [OPTIONS]`: Runs inference.
      * `--model`: Path to trained model (`.keras` or `.onnx`).
      * `--input-data`: Path to inference data (CSV/JSON, usually raw if using preprocessor).
      * `--input-cols`: Specify feature columns/keys in the input data.
      * `--json-*`: Specify keys if loading raw JSON.
      * `--preprocessor-path`: Optional path to saved preprocessor object (.joblib) to apply to input data.
      * `--output`: Optional path to save predictions (CSV).
  * `sygnals-nn convert [OPTIONS]`: Converts Keras to ONNX.
      * `--keras-model`: Input `.keras` model path.
