      * `--input-signature`: Optional explicit input signature string.
  * `sygnals-nn export [OPTIONS]`: Exports predictions file to different formats.
      * `--predictions`: Input predictions file (usually CSV).
      * `--format`: `csv`, `json`, `raw`.
